<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals officials to hold routine meeting.</title>
<headline>EU cereals officials to hold routine meeting.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee will decide the usual cereals and rice tenders on Thursday, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be some discussion about a few technical points under any other business but no other decisions are expected,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
